xtreme won the iF Design Award 2025, a global symbol of excellent design.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>03/18/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe Ace Extreme Media review Award of iF design Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://ifdesign.com/en/winner-ranking/project/rog-harpe-ace-extreme/688808\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202503041634167520985.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Techpowerup Highly Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      techpowerup.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Techpowerup Highly Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Die Kohlefaserschale ist wunderschön verarbeitet, und die schiere Anzahl an Zubehör, die im Lieferumfang der Maus enthalten ist, ist eine zusätzliche Bestätigung für sie. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>02/06/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe Ace Extreme Media review Award of Techpowerup Highly Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techpowerup.com/review/asus-rog-harpe-ace-extreme/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202501171844353560830.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Five stars\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      eurogamer.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Five stars</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Beautifully crafted, beautiful and very light, without sacrificing many features\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>01/14/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe Ace Extreme Media review Award of Five stars\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.eurogamer.de/asus-rog-harpe-extreme-im-test-was-bringt-die-nobel-maus-fur-300-euro-wirklich\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202411282055486840915.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Rating: 1,21\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      pcgameshardware.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Rating: 1,21</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      As the overall rating of 1.21 also shows, the Asus Harpe Ace Extreme is definitely a gaming mouse that comes highly recommended. It has a great look, is made of high-quality materials, has useful features and the latest technology.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>11/28/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe Ace Extreme Media review Award of Rating: 1,21\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://ratgeber.pcgameshardware.de/asus-harpe-ace-extreme-test/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/201911081918512270060.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Cowcotland\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Harpe Ace Extreme is an ultra-complete mouse for those who want the maximum a mouse can offer and more.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>02/27/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe Ace Extreme Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.cowcotland.com/articles/4526/asus-rog-harpe-ace-extreme-du-carbone-et-des-performances.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202503272114566210340.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"10 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Gameblog.fr\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>10 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It's hard to find anything to complain about with this impressive ROG Harpe Ace Extreme. The materials are top-of-the-range, the finishes impeccable and meticulous, not to mention the on-board technologies that make it extremely powerful, even without any prior adjustment.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>01/26/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe Ace Extreme Media review Award of 10 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gameblog.fr/tech/hardware/tests/test-rog-harpe-ace-extreme-souris-hors-norme-658358\"